    "description": {
      "value": "Script in a language of the Outer Planes adorns this book's spine, and a deity's symbol is etched on its cover. Books of warding prayers are each devoted to a particular deity and are also a religious symbol of that deity.\n\n- **Activate:** Free Action\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n- **Trigger:** Your last action was to cast a prepared divine spell granted by your deity\n\nChoose chaotic, evil, good, or lawful; you can't choose a type that's part of your deity's alignment. You and all allies within 30 feet are suffused with your deity's protection, gaining resistance 10 to damage of that type for 1 minute."
